{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>in the land He will repay him</b> — while he yet lives, HaShem repays him for the good deed." "<b>indeed</b> — likewise the wicked, He repays them the reward of their deeds before their death, as in the matter of “before His face He will repay him.”"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:16.728511186Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}